Types of operating system :

// there are majorly 7 types of operating system . 
1) uni - operating system 
2) mutli - programming operating system 
3) multi - user operating system 
4) mutli - tasking operating system 
5) multi - process operating system 
6) embed system operating system 
7) real time operating sysem 
8) hand held operating system 



1) uni - programming operating system : 
                  the operating system which allows only one process known as uni - programming operating system .



2) multi - programming operating system :
                  the operating system which allows more than one process known as multi - programming operating system . 
*) preemptive : process can be forcefully stopped its execution .  
*) non preemptive : process can be executed untill their wish .




3) multi - tasking operating system : 
                  the operatin system allows multiple operations known as multi - tasking operating system 
                    eg : Round robin 



4) mutli - user operating system : 
                  the operating system which allows to use multiple user in one hardware is known as mutli - user operating system . 



5) multi - process operating system :
                  the operating system which allows multiple cpu on one process known as mutli - process operating system . 
*) loosely coupled :( shares memory ) : multiple system shares memory known as loosely coupled operating system .
*) tightly coupled : ( distrubuted system ) .


6) embeded system operating system :
                  operating system which is used in hardware like ac , mechanical or robotical car . 



7) real time operating system : 
                  used in ISRO and DRDO for to judge according to the environment .



8) hand held device operating system : 
                  which is used in the mobile devices known as hand held operating devices . 
